"Progress (%)" = "进度（%）";
"Re-announce Torrents" = "重新通告种子";
"Re-checks the local data of the given torrents on a Transmission server. Torrents is required: verifying a whole large library can stall the daemon." = "重新校验指定种子的本地数据。必须提供 Torrents：校验整个大型库可能使守护进程停滞。";
"Removes torrents from a Transmission server, optionally deleting their downloaded data." = "从 Transmission 服务器移除种子，可选择删除其已下载数据。";
"Reports progress and transfer speeds for a single torrent on a Transmission server." = "报告单个种子在 Transmission 服务器上的进度和传输速度。";
"Resume Torrents" = "继续种子";
"Resumes torrents on a Transmission server. Leave Torrents empty to resume them all." = "继续 Transmission 服务器上的种子。Torrents 留空则继续全部。";
"Returns the Transmission servers configured in the app, so a shortcut can pick one or loop over them." = "返回应用中配置的 Transmission 服务器，以便快捷指令选择一个或循环处理。";
"Returns the torrents on a Transmission server, so a shortcut can pick one or loop over them. The filters are combined with AND: a torrent must match every filter you set, and a filter you leave blank is ignored." = "返回 Transmission 服务器上的种子，以便快捷指令选择一个或循环处理。筛选条件按 AND 组合：种子必须匹配所有已设置的筛选，留空的筛选会被忽略。";
"Returns torrent counts, transfer speeds, free space and turtle state from a Transmission server." = "返回 Transmission 服务器的种子数量、传输速度、可用空间和乌龟模式状态。";
"Server ID" = "服务器 ID";
"Server Info" = "服务器信息";
"Set Server Speed Limits" = "设置服务器速度限制";
"Set Torrent Speed Limits" = "设置种子速度限制";
"Set Turtle Mode" = "设置乌龟模式";
"Sets a Transmission server's global download and upload speed limits (KB/s)." = "设置 Transmission 服务器的全局下载和上传速度限制（KB/s）。";
"Sets per-torrent download and upload speed limits (KB/s) on the given torrents." = "设置指定种子的单种子下载和上传速度限制（KB/s）。";
"Torrent Count" = "种子数";
"Torrent Stats" = "种子统计";
"Torrent Status" = "种子状态";
"Torrents" = "种子";
